    "chunk_text": "\u2022 Provide facilities for offshore and deep-sea fishing vessels to overcome existing operational constraints.\n\n\u2022 Attract private investment for cement, fertilizer and other industrial facilities.\n\n\u2022 Provide bunkering facilities for coastal and offshore vessels.\n\n817 818\n\n\u0dad\u0dd0\u0dd4\u0dc0 \u0dbb\u0db8\u0dda \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dda\u0dc1\u0db1\u0dc1 \u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc4\u0db1\u0dc1\n\n2026 \u0dc3\u0db1\u0db4\u0dca\u0db1\u0db1\u0dca\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd 08\n\n\u2022 Annex 04: Cabinet Memorandum No. 2005/13 dated 30th June, 2005 submitted to obtain the approval of the Cabinet of Ministers for the award of the contract for the construction of the Oluvil Port Project.\n\nSir, I table* all these four Annexes.\n\n3. It happened in 2005, 21 years ago. So, it is very difficult to find the relevant documents. Therefore, we are not in a position to submit those documents. 4. Loan assistance had been provided by the Nordea Bank Denmark A/S for the Oluvil Port Development Project. The Loan Agreement between the Ministry of Finance, Planning and Economic Development of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka and the Nordea Bank Denmark A/S for the financing of the Oluvil Port Development Project was signed on 23rd May, 2008. I table* a copy of the Loan Agreement as Annex 05."
