    "chunk_text": "3. It happened in 2005, 21 years ago. So, it is very difficult to find the relevant documents. Therefore, we are not in a position to submit those documents. 4. Loan assistance had been provided by the Nordea Bank Denmark A/S for the Oluvil Port Development Project. The Loan Agreement between the Ministry of Finance, Planning and Economic Development of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka and the Nordea Bank Denmark A/S for the financing of the Oluvil Port Development Project was signed on 23rd May, 2008. I table* a copy of the Loan Agreement as Annex 05.\n\nDHI - Denmark, focusing on coastal sediment transport, siltation and erosion and sustainable mitigation measures for Oluvil Port.\n\n6. According to the Cabinet Decisions received regarding the Oluvil Port, the following actions had been taken by the Sri Lanka Ports Authority - SLPA.\n\nTransfer of Fishery Harbour \u2022 Cabinet Decision No.16/2061/725/009-I dated 26.10.2016 approved the transfer of Lots 01 and 04 of the Oluvil Fishery Harbour to the Ministry of Fisheries. \u2022 An MoU between SLPA and the Ministry of Fisheries was signed on 09.05.2022 to formalize the transfer. \u2022 The facilities were intended to be operated as a fishery harbour.\n\nCalling for EoI/RFP for the long-term lease of lands and buildings belonging to Sri Lanka Ports Authority at Oluvil for port-related industries/ business ventures"
